{"id":"npc:%E5%B8%8C%E5%B0%94","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"小丘郡驻军副官，对塔拉人表现出极度敌视，协助汉密尔顿上校进行着他的计划。却在小丘郡驻军败局已定时身着制服出现在“深池”的队伍中。后续出现于威灵顿公爵的军队中，死后仍在战场上向萨卡兹进攻。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情9-1 风暴突击、9-2 鬼魂危机、9-6 深池等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_248.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_248.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_248.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_244.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_244.png"}],"appearances":[]}